// A complete song using only the v0.1 parser MVP features (PARSER_MVP.md).
title "MVP Song"
artist "Example Artist"
key G
tempo 96
time_signature 4/4

section Intro
| G | C | G | D |

section Verse 1
||: G | Em | C | D :|| x2    // repeat the four bars twice
| G | Em | Am7 | D7sus4 |

section Chorus
||: C | G/B | Am7 | D :||     // default repeat count is 2
| N.C. | G |                 // trailing comment
